# MOUNT - Mount a host image in cpmsim

```text
MOUNT drive: host-image
MOUNT /LIST [selector:]
```

## Inspect and mount

```text
MOUNT /LIST
MOUNT D: "Work Disk.dsk"
```

Use a readable raw disk image and one drive letter. Relative host paths
start in the emulator's working directory. The guest drive's format must
match the image; see [CONFIG](CONFIG.HLP). MOUNT is specific to cpmsim.

## Detach an image

```text
MOUNT /UNMOUNT D:
```

Close files on the guest drive before changing its image. For individual
file transfers, use [R](R.HLP) or [W](W.HLP).
